      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- works on a single promise\n- create or open repair thread\n- opens a disposable box\n- measure the promise in the box\n- for each attempt:\n  - dispatch confined repair agent\n  - measure the promise in the box\n  - assemble repair receipt\n  - run adverserial assessor pass\n  - trigger rework if rejected",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "qYJBXQQgjRupREk0TUUhD",
      "originalText": "- works on a single promise\n- create or open repair thread\n- opens a disposable box\n- measure the promise in the box\n- for each attempt:\n  - dispatch confined repair agent\n  - measure the promise in the box\n  - assemble repair receipt\n  - run adverserial assessor pass\n  - trigger rework if rejected",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
