      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791048762394,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- works on a single repair thread\n- given a specific target (e.g. main)\n- run landing gate in target\nworkspace\n- if the gated landing fails, refuse\nand record why, exit\n- take the repo-global land flock\n- compare and swap target refs\n- release land flock\n- record landing in kept ledger",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "6Us_8hqQ0BkkhivsVoUOw",
      "originalText": "- works on a single repair thread\n- given a specific target (e.g. main)\n- run landing gate in target workspace\n- if the gated landing fails, refuse and record why, exit\n- take the repo-global land flock\n- compare and swap target refs\n- release land flock\n- record landing in kept ledger",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
