      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791044849305,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  Promise - a commitment that should always be kept\n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "vjoeufnkyhAgUfrPcM0U2",
      "originalText": "  Promise - a commitment that should always be kept\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "hpey3_8mKZYU6Eg33qGbh",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3164.587433996883,
      "y": 2573.7655676207214,
      "width": 854.5238866827546,
      "height": 315,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#40c057",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9Ch",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2056330026,
      "version": 1742,
      "versionNonce": 846002550,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791044849305,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Every tick, gather observations, evaluate the\npredicate, and record whether it holds. \n\nIf it doesn't, it shows up as drift and a person\ncan use kept repair to fix it.\n\nThen use kept to repair not-kept promises.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Every tick, gather observations, evaluate the predicate, and record whether it holds. \n\nIf it doesn't, it shows up as drift and a person can use kept repair to fix it.\n\nThen use kept to repair not-kept promises.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "CQVIQzhx8AfmPb6I5Tq3M",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 5232.6888896021765,
      "y": 2493.628464032696,
      "width": 992.5747510590306,
      "height": 490.90986587003084,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9Cr",
