      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791044849305,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "  Decision - a ratified record of a choice and why \n",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": "CQVIQzhx8AfmPb6I5Tq3M",
      "originalText": "  Decision - a ratified record of a choice and why \n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "C8dmnhCY_RaXuPl5g3vgQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 5287.007190201835,
      "y": 2573.7655676207214,
      "width": 854.5238866827546,
      "height": 360,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#40c057",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9D8",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 322532726,
      "version": 2508,
      "versionNonce": 908043574,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791044849305,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Record a choice and rationale that artifacts\nand agents can cite.\n\nkept does not inherently check Decisions. They\nhave no truth.\n\nDecisiosns are ratified and that standing is\nautomatically revoked on (most) edits.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Record a choice and rationale that artifacts and agents can cite.\n\nkept does not inherently check Decisions. They have no truth.\n\nDecisiosns are ratified and that standing is automatically revoked on (most) edits.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "DFKSmqG42aDhacno5EYYR",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 4171.4790114997,
      "y": 2493.628464032696,
      "width": 992.5747510590306,
      "height": 490.90986587003084,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#2f9e44",
      "backgroundColor": "#b2f2bb",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9DG",
      "roundness": {
        "type": 3
      },
