      "index": "b9YK",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1848860470,
      "version": 1846,
      "versionNonce": 1586561398,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791047845420,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "recording what you're committed to...",
      "fontSize": 78.91354884064532,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "recording what you're committed to...",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "S0ve34v7W7_0Lvg0CovoH",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3148.2407832731265,
      "y": -5636.728091031883,
      "width": 2371.7158466659484,
      "height": 690.4935523556466,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9YO",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 51287990,
      "version": 2451,
      "versionNonce": 1356969386,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791049522428,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "I've built experimental systems exploring different parts of\nthis space\n\nawiki, chopworks - agent-friendly content models & factories\nadsr, grft - agentic desired state reconcilers\nharness - agent governance, oversight, and confinement\nbacklog - opinionated concurrent sdlc workflows & work items",
      "fontSize": 78.91354884064532,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "I've built experimental systems exploring different parts of this space\n\nawiki, chopworks - agent-friendly content models & factories\nadsr, grft - agentic desired state reconcilers\nharness - agent governance, oversight, and confinement\nbacklog - opinionated concurrent sdlc workflows & work items ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ejWiP8VXdkTMH3kAPQMsv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3274.2951504170974,
      "y": -843.3126910800926,
      "width": 2349.4772092446915,
      "height": 197.2838721016133,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9YV",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2043922602,
      "version": 1369,
      "versionNonce": 1308598710,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791045281931,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "kept operates on a corpus of artifacts and local state that\nlive next to your project files stored in a git workspace",
      "fontSize": 78.91354884064532,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "kept operates on a corpus of artifacts and local state that live next to your project files stored in a git workspace",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "dzux4o9afsGYLC_IulXqc",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4513.31659090544,
      "y": -392.29814849184766,
      "width": 1847.5931443722043,
      "height": 1479.6290407620997,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9Yl",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2095014762,
      "version": 2823,
      "versionNonce": 1282798134,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791045277476,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "the corpus is a graph of authored markdown\ncontent with schema'd metadata frontmatter\n \n\n\n\n\n\nkept tracks an artifact's standing and truth\n\n- standing - does this specific version of an\nartifact obligate the project to do something?\n\n- truth - is this specific version of an artifact,\nin a specific working tree meeting expectations?",
      "fontSize": 78.91354884064532,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "the corpus is a graph of authored markdown content with schema'd metadata frontmatter\n \n\n\n\n\n\nkept tracks an artifact's standing and truth\n\n- standing - does this specific version of an artifact obligate the project to do something?\n\n- truth - is this specific version of an artifact, in a specific working tree meeting expectations?",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ycyU7J3NVTNDUXCqLs3Bv",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3374.083780597032,
      "y": 1818.8875618578581,
      "width": 2312.6591582794367,
      "height": 394.5677442032266,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9Yp",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 682592246,
      "version": 3109,
      "versionNonce": 842102390,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791049660087,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "on top of this content model, kept understands six built-in\nkinds of artifacts\n\nthese provide the common kinds that popped up frequently ",
      "fontSize": 78.91354884064532,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "on top of this content model, kept understands six built-in kinds of artifacts\n\nthese provide the common kinds that popped up frequently ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "TwV4I9YuN-K87OKXPAs7Q",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 4343.352596623687,
      "y": 4818.103956728657,
      "width": 1993.909045261697,
      "height": 986.4193605080665,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9Yt",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 488068406,
      "version": 3506,
      "versionNonce": 854111670,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791048657618,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "an append-only record of important events in the\nkept lifecycle\n\nstored as a commit graph that lives on its own ref \n\nkept operates on it but nobody checks it out \n\nreading from and writing to it areintentional\n\ndoes not litter your repo's git log",
      "fontSize": 78.91354884064532,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "an append-only record of important events in the kept lifecycle\n\nstored as a commit graph that lives on its own ref \n\nkept operates on it but nobody checks it out \n\nreading from and writing to it areintentional\n\ndoes not litter your repo's git log",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "PKdK1_kkyR36mOKhj-8we",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3182.7851105577947,
      "y": 4465.454989491918,
      "width": 2554.755084810925,
      "height": 197.2838721016133,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
