      "version": 5381,
      "versionNonce": 1917567158,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791050855032,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "today \n- kept is starting to keep kept kept\n- most of the challenge is in shaping desires and turning those\ninto high-quality promises\n\nupcoming\n- constantly trying to simplify mental model and operating it\n- models and agent runtimes constantly improve so... shrug? \n- auto-dispatch repair -> review -> land during tick\n- agentic desire shaping and promise quality feedback \n- budget enforcement & budget-informed dispatch\n",
      "fontSize": 78.91354884064532,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "today \n- kept is starting to keep kept kept\n- most of the challenge is in shaping desires and turning those into high-quality promises\n\nupcoming\n- constantly trying to simplify mental model and operating it\n- models and agent runtimes constantly improve so... shrug? \n- auto-dispatch repair -> review -> land during tick\n- agentic desire shaping and promise quality feedback \n- budget enforcement & budget-informed dispatch\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ldeyohB1Tf2n1rd-8zPpQ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3251.454068634436,
      "y": 23366.059942558437,
      "width": 2545.472257860893,
      "height": 1282.3451686604865,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff9db",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9Yz",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 403158634,
      "version": 5235,
      "versionNonce": 1371668022,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1791049011246,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "in addition to promises and policies, kept has special sauce for\nsome artifact types\n\ndecisions - numbering, standing provides robust status, links\nenable hierarchy of ratification\n\ndesires - kept reduces chance of premature (or unintended)\ncommitment through a lifecycle that encourages clarifying wants\ninto promises, policies, and decisions while automatically tracking\nstatus\n\nfacts - a lightweight mechanism for recording past observations\nwith no standing that can be referenced by other artifacts",
      "fontSize": 78.91354884064532,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "in addition to promises and policies, kept has special sauce for some artifact types\n\ndecisions - numbering, standing provides robust status, links enable hierarchy of ratification\n\ndesires - kept reduces chance of premature (or unintended) commitment through a lifecycle that encourages clarifying wants into promises, policies, and decisions while automatically tracking status\n\nfacts - a lightweight mechanism for recording past observations with no standing that can be referenced by other artifacts",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
